  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your line consists of Fironkhai ancestors, whose history was shrouded in mysteries of which fiend may have influenced your families to grant them the short form with batlike ears that you now inherit. You are Small. You gain fire resistance equal to half your level, and you gain the Illuminate cantrip which you can cast as an innate divine spell at will. When you do, an extremity you have – such as the tip of your fingers, or if you somehow have a tail – is also a valid light source that can spark alight with harmless flame.</span></p>"
